    <string name="help_title">How to play</string>
    <string name="help_body">1. Add at least two players in seating order, then choose the dealer, deal direction and trump mode.\n\n2. Each player bids how many tricks they expect to take. Bidding starts after the dealer, who bids last. Total bids must differ from the number of cards dealt. The latest bid can be edited until the next player bids.\n\n3. After play, select Won for an exact bid and Lost for a missed bid. The app rejects combinations that cannot share all the tricks.\n\n4. A successful bid scores 10 + the bid. A successful bid of three earns 13 points. A missed bid scores zero.\n\n5. The dealer advances one seat after each round. Fixed trump cycles through Spades, Diamonds, Clubs and Hearts by round number. In Custom mode, trump is chosen at the table.\n\nUse Game options for player changes, dealer changes or score corrections. Structural changes after bidding starts require restarting the current round. Leaving the app preserves your game. Resume from Home.\n\nSaved players are an optional library. Saving or removing a profile does not change an existing game.</string>
